A Practical Suggestion
1. Minimum Viable Product (Days 1–15):
   * Mock API
   * eBPF event capture
   * Python parser
   * Database
2. Core Security Features (Days 16–25):
   * Shadow API detection
   * Zombie API detection
   * BOLA detection
   * React dashboard
3. Advanced Features (Days 26–30):
   * Rate limiting
   * PII masking
   * Runtime blocking (or simulated blocking if kernel enforcement is out of scope)
   * Performance testing and documentation
